.cp-ops {
  position: fixed;
  left: 416px;
  top: 16px;
  width: 72px;
  padding-left: 8px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  z-index: 92;
}
.cp-ops.port {
  left: 348px;
  top: var(--head-h);
}
/* ★★★ 274b（用户口径第 3 条）· **多选那一档也贴抽屉右侧**，不从抽屉里穿 ────
